      *
      *Embedded SQL in an OPM COBOL member. The statement layout is the
      *same as in ILE COBOL: EXEC SQL on one line, END-EXEC to close.
      *
      *Member: SQLOPM   Compilable: no (calculations only, no files)
      *Source: IBM i 7.5 Embedded SQL programming, coding SQL statements
      *        in COBOL applications.
      *Retrieved: 2026-07-29
      *
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SQLOPM.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA END-EXEC.
       01  CUST-NAME               PIC X(30).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       GET-NAME.
           EXEC SQL
             SELECT CUSNAM INTO :CUST-NAME FROM CUSTMAST
           END-EXEC.
           STOP RUN.
